Z||000003||Fformula88||10-29-2001||03:41 PM||||I saw it in Motor Trend.  I like the motor concept, which they thought will be a go and appear in future Caddy's.  They do not htink, however, the car will see production.  Its an Evoq-like styled hand built exotic for those who are not familiar with it.  Price would be well over $100,000.  GM won't be able to justify the costs to build this thing right now, but it sure is thinking in the right direction!<P>I personally don't like the new Caddy/Evoq styling thing going on.  Please Bob lutz, do something about it!  (Actually he has  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">, he's already ordered changes to the upcoming Seville's styling!  He said after talking to the designers nobody there ecven liked how it looked!  Thats GM for ya!)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
